0.0175 Tw
(The Code of Federal Regulations is a codification of the general and permanent )Tj
-1.25 -1.25 TD
0.11 Tw
(rules published in the Federal Register by the Executive departments and agen-)Tj
T*
0.01 Tw
(cies of the Federal Government. The Code is divided into 50 titles which represent )Tj
T*
0.26 Tw
(broad areas subject to Federal regulation. Each title is divided into chapters )Tj
T*
0.095 Tw
(which usually bear the name of the issuing agency. Each chapter is further sub-)Tj
T*
-0.0025 Tw
(divided into parts covering specific regulatory areas. )Tj
1.25 -1.425 TD
0.0475 Tw
(Each volume of the Code is revised at least once each calendar year and issued )Tj
-1.25 -1.25 TD
-0.0025 Tw
(on a quarterly basis approximately as follows: )Tj
2.5 -1.425 TD
[(Title 1 through Title 16)-25(..............................................................as of January 1 )]TJ
0 -1.175 TD
