T*
[(Title 28 through Title 41)-195(..................................................................as of July 1 )]TJ
T*
[(Title 42 through Title 50)-120(.............................................................as of October 1 )]TJ
-1.25 -1.8 TD
(The appropriate revision date is printed on the cover of each volume. )Tj
-1.25 -1.8 TD
(LEGAL STATUS )Tj
1.25 -1.8 TD
0.135 Tw
(The contents of the Federal Register are required to be judicially noticed \(44 )Tj
-1.25 -1.25 TD
0.09 Tw
(U.S.C. 1507\). The Code of Federal Regulations is prima facie evidence of the text )Tj
T*
-0.0025 Tw
(of the original documents \(44 U.S.C. 1510\). )Tj
0 -1.8 TD
(HOW TO USE THE CODE OF FEDERAL REGULATIONS )Tj
1.25 -1.8 TD
0.19 Tw
(The Code of Federal Regulations is kept up to date by the individual issues )Tj
-1.25 -1.25 TD
0.115 Tw
(of the Federal Register. These two publications must be used together to deter-)Tj
T*
-0.0025 Tw
(mine the latest version of any given rule. )Tj
1.25 -1.425 TD
0.06 Tw
(To determine whether a Code volume has been amended since its revision date )Tj
-1.25 -1.25 TD
0.015 Tw
(\(in this case, January 1, 2005\), consult the ëëList of CFR Sections Affected \(LSA\),íí )Tj
T*
0.24 Tw
(which is issued monthly, and the ëëCumulative List of Parts Affected,íí which )Tj
T*
0.0725 Tw
(appears in the Reader Aids section of the daily Federal Register. These two lists )Tj
T*
0.1375 Tw
(will identify the Federal Register page number of the latest amendment of any )Tj
T*
-0.0025 Tw
(given rule. )Tj
0 -1.7875 TD
(EFFECTIVE AND EXPIRATION DATES )Tj
1.25 -1.7875 TD
0.1225 Tw
(Each volume of the Code contains amendments published in the Federal Reg-)Tj
-1.25 -1.25 TD
0.26 Tw
(ister since the last revision of that volume of the Code. Source citations for )Tj
T*
0.0125 Tw
(the regulations are referred to by volume number and page number of the Federal )Tj
T*
0.1475 Tw
(Register and date of publication. Publication dates and effective dates are usu-)Tj
T*
0.2275 Tw
(ally not the same and care must be exercised by the user in determining the )Tj
T*
0.2225 Tw
(actual effective date. In instances where the effective date is beyond the cut- )Tj
T*
0.2675 Tw
(off date for the Code a note has been inserted to reflect the future effective )Tj
T*
0.2425 Tw
(date. In those instances where a regulation published in the Federal Register )Tj
T*
0.0075 Tw
(states a date certain for expiration, an appropriate note will be inserted following )Tj
T*
-0.0025 Tw
(the text. )Tj
0 -1.7875 TD
